dening, not behavior gaps — all behavior is merged, tested observable-behaviour-style, and CI-green. This ticket carries the remainder so the parent could close honestly.\n\n## Scope (from the parent's AC1-AC3 residuals; full tables in the parent's close-out comment)\n1. AC1 residual: add call-count/monkeypatch assertions on the shared confirmation reduce path so a future regression that bypasses the shared seam (printing per-verb again) is caught structurally, not just per-verb by exact-line tests.\n2. AC2 residual: ship the verb inventory table (no-op-capable vs always-writes) as generated or hand-maintained documentation (docs/cli-reference or a test-enforced table), so the no-op contract is enumerable.\n3. AC3 residual: record the per-verb old→new confirmation-line mapping (the parent's comment has the full table) in docs or the test suite as golden data.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Reduce-path structural assertion exists (call-count or seam-spy) covering at least create/link/transition.\n- [ ] Verb inventory (no-op-capable vs always-writes) lives in a durable, reviewable location and a test fails when a verb is added without classification.\n- [ ] Old→new mapping table recorded in docs or golden test data.\n- [ ] make lint / make typecheck clean; lands via Gerrit.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0c00-0649-32da-41a5","ticket_type":"task","title":"Tapeworm follow-up: reduce-path structural tests + verb no-op inventory + confirmation-line mapping record","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["fb3b03fd-a224-43f8-a2af-b10b03bf6e7f","4bd9a550-5098-47de-a449-21c17540ff8c"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPS